WEBVTT

00:00:55.968 --> 00:01:00.640
And there is up to 811 million people
on the planet who are hungry.

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:02.683
So what can we do about it?

00:01:03.101 --> 00:01:05.937
I think innovation
and technology is the answer.

00:01:06.562 --> 00:01:07.980
A couple of years ago,

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:11.526
a friend and I realized
that United Nations World Food Programme

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:16.197
can feed a child for a full day
for only 80 cents.

00:01:17.198 --> 00:01:18.491
We were shocked.

00:01:19.117 --> 00:01:21.577
We thought, if more people
knew about this,

00:01:21.577 --> 00:01:22.954
if we made it easy,

00:01:22.995 --> 00:01:25.248
imagine you were having dinner
with your friends

00:01:25.248 --> 00:01:26.791
and you're enjoying yourselves,

00:01:26.791 --> 00:01:29.669
wouldn't you want to share
your meal with a child in need?

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:33.089
And that's exactly why we founded
an app called Share the Meal.